                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Democrats are fearmongering \u2014 there are NO provisions in the House Budget bill that cut Social Security, Medicare, or Medicaid. Don't believe me? Read the bill for yourself.  \n\nThis bill is a blueprint to accomplish President Trump's agenda: lower taxes, securing the border, and lowering energy costs. THAT'S what Democrats are voting against.",
