                "retweet_count": 312,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8The House just PASSED the Republican Budget Resolution to jumpstart President Trump\u2019s America First Agenda! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nHere\u2019s the truth: this budget does NOT cut Social Security, Medicare, or Medicaid. \n\nThis budget will allow us to lower taxes, cut energy costs, secure the border, and root out waste, fraud, and corruption \u2014 putting money back in the hands of hardworking families. Read the bill for yourself.\n\nYet, 214 Democrats chose fearmongering over facts, voting against relief for everyday Americans. Shameful.",
